This project includes a converted Shadow Dexterous Hand model from MuJoCo
Menagerie, from the shadow_hand directory at commit b065505. The upstream model
and meshes are licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie/tree/b065505/shadow_hand

The converted USDZ keeps the visual geometry and the rest transforms. It omits
the physics, collision geometry and actuators. The application drives the
visual links with its own finger poses. See Licenses/MuJoCo-Menagerie-Shadow-Hand.txt
for the upstream license and App/Resources/ShadowHand.usdz for the derivative.
